WEBVTT

00:02:28.186 --> 00:02:33.816
(Applause)

00:02:34.525 --> 00:02:38.029
It's not an accident that 80 percent
of the world's remaining biodiversity

00:02:38.029 --> 00:02:42.909
are located on lands managed and loved
by Indigenous peoples.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.661
We have been in relationships
with the plants and animals

00:02:45.661 --> 00:02:48.206
of our territories
and waters for millennia.

00:02:48.873 --> 00:02:50.499
We care for each other.

00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:53.502
The Innu people have loved and sustained

00:02:53.502 --> 00:02:57.673
and been in harmony with our landscapes
for nearly 10,000 years.

00:02:58.132 --> 00:03:02.845
Surely we have values, insights,
strategies and knowledge to offer